### Get Meta
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard/admin/v1/meta
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Overview KPIs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard/admin/v1/kpis/overview?date=2025-10-07
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get KPIs by Check-in Type
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard/admin/v1/kpis/by-checkin-type?date=2025-10-07
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Hourly Series
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard/admin/v1/series/hourly?date=2025-10-07
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Quarterly Series
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard/admin/v1/series/quarters?date=2025-10-07
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Top Workshops
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard/admin/v1/tops/workshops?date=2025-10-07&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get No-Shows
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard/admin/v1/noshow?date=2025-10-07
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
